EN — The Markdown files under mds/ are derivative works of publicly published
design standards (GB, GB/T, JGJ, EN 1993, AISI, etc.). They are provided for
reading, searching, citing, and diffing across revisions only. They are NOT a
substitute for the official published standard. The maintainers make no
representation as to the accuracy or completeness of any OCR-derived content.
Always consult the issuing body (SAC, CEN, AISI, …) for the authoritative
text. Where this Markdown and the official standard differ, the official
standard prevails.

